msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Hunter-Schmidt"
msgstr "亨特(Hunter)-施密特(Schmidt)"

msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Hunter-Schmidt (SSC)"

msgstr "Hunter-Schmidt（SSC）"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Sidik-Jonkman"
msgstr "Sidik和Jonkman"

msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Empirical Bayes"
msgstr "經驗貝氏"

msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Paule-Mandel"
msgstr "Paule和Mandel"

msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Paule-Mandel (MU)"

msgstr "Paule-Mandel（MU）"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Include heterogeneity"

msgstr "包含異質性"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Include heterogeneity (𝜏) in the funnel plot under the alternative "
"hypothesis. If unselected, the heterogeneity estimate is not used to adjust "
"the prediction intervals."

msgstr "在對立假設下的漏斗圖中包含異質性（𝜏）。若未選取，則不使用異質性估計值調整預測區間。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Estimates table"

msgstr "估計值表"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Summarize the effect size and heterogeneity estimates used for the funnel "
"plot under the alternative hypothesis in a table."

msgstr "以表格摘要對立假設下用於漏斗圖之效果量與異質性估計值。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Fixed value for the mean effect size under the alternative hypothesis."

msgstr "對立假設下平均效果量的固定值。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Fixed value for 𝜏, representing the heterogeneity under the alternative "
"hypothesis."

msgstr "𝜏 的固定值，代表對立假設下的異質性。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Fill the funnel plot's prediction intervals under the alternative hypothesis "
"with different colors."

msgstr "以不同顏色填入對立假設下漏斗圖的預測區間。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Set the type of line of the funnel plot's prediction intervals under the "
"alternative hypothesis."

msgstr "設定對立假設下漏斗圖預測區間的線條類型。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Power enhancement"

msgstr "檢定力提升"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Visualize power levels to detect the effect size under the alternative "
"hypothesis with alpha = 0.05."

msgstr "以 alpha = 0.05 視覺化對立假設下偵測效果量的檢定力水準。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Breaks"

msgstr "間斷點"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Specify the breakpoints for power enhancement. All levels must be within the "
"0.05 - 1 range."

msgstr "指定檢定力提升的間斷點。所有水準必須介於 0.05 – 1 之間。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Estimates Mapping"

msgstr "估計值對應"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Set mapping for labels, colors, and shapes of the effect size estimates."

msgstr "設定效果量估計值的標籤、顏色與形狀對應。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Label"

msgstr "標籤"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Show all or only a subset of the effect size estimate labels."

msgstr "顯示全部或僅部分效果量估計值標籤。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "All"

msgstr "全部"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Outside H₀"

msgstr "H₀ 之外"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Outside H₁"

msgstr "H₁ 之外"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Color"

msgstr "顏色"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Map colors of the effect size estimates in the funnel plot based on the "
"selected variable."

msgstr "根據所選變項對應漏斗圖中效果量估計值的顏色。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Shape"

msgstr "形狀"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Map shapes of the effect size estimates in the funnel plot based on the "
"selected variable."

msgstr "根據所選變項對應漏斗圖中效果量估計值的形狀。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Legend position"

msgstr "圖例位置"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Set the legend position of the funnel plot. Available when color or shape "
"mapping is enabled."

msgstr "設定漏斗圖的圖例位置。啟用顏色或形狀對應時可用。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Bottom"

msgstr "底部"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Right"

msgstr "右方"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Top"

msgstr "頂部"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Left"

msgstr "左方"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Label offset"

msgstr "標籤偏移"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Adjust the offset of labels in the funnel plot."

msgstr "調整漏斗圖中標籤的偏移量。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Funnel prediction interval"

msgstr "漏斗預測區間"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Specify the confidence levels for the funnel plot prediction intervals."
msgstr "指定漏斗圖預測區間的信賴水準。"

msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Invert colors"

msgstr "反轉顏色"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Invert the colors used in the funnel plot."

msgstr "反轉漏斗圖中使用的顏色。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Meta-regression"

msgstr "統合迴歸"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "進階的"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Advanced options for the meta-analysis, including optimization settings, "
"clustering, and permutation tests."

msgstr "統合分析的進階選項，包括最佳化設定、叢集與置換檢定。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Show metafor R code"

msgstr "顯示 metafor R 程式碼"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Display the underlying R code used by the metafor package to fit the model."

msgstr "顯示 metafor 套件用以適配模型的底層 R 程式碼。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Weighted estimation"

msgstr "加權估計"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Perform weighted estimation using inverse-variance weights. Uncheck for "
"unweighted estimation."

msgstr "使用反向變異數權重進行加權估計。取消勾選則為未加權估計。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Clustering"

msgstr "叢集"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Use clubSandwich"

msgstr "使用 clubSandwich"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Use the clubSandwich package for robust variance estimation in clustered "
"data. Enabled when a clustering variable is specified."

msgstr "使用 clubSandwich 套件對叢集資料進行穩健變異數估計。指定叢集變項時啟用。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Small sample correction"

msgstr "小樣本校正"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Apply a small-sample correction to the clustered standard errors."

msgstr "對叢集標準誤套用小樣本校正。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Random Effects / Modele Structure"

msgstr "隨機效果／模型結構"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Use sparse matricies"

msgstr "使用稀疏矩陣"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Use sparse matrix representations to speed up computations in models with "
"large datasets or complex random effects structures. Available in multilevel/"
"multivariate meta-analysis."

msgstr "使用稀疏矩陣表示以加速具有大型資料集或複雜隨機效果結構之模型的計算。適用於多層／多變量統合分析。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Compute covariance matrix"

msgstr "計算共變異數矩陣"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Compute the covariance matrix of the parameter estimates. Available in "
"multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis."

msgstr "計算參數估計值的共變異數矩陣。適用於多層／多變量統合分析。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Fix Parameters"

msgstr "固定參數"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "𝜏²"

msgstr "𝜏²"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Fix the value of 𝜏² in the model instead of estimating it. Unavailable in "
"multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis or with meta-regression model for "
"heterogeneity. A more complex heterogeneity terms in the multilevel/"
"multivariate meta-analysis can be fixed via the 'Extend metafor call' option."

msgstr "固定模型中 𝜏² 的值而不進行估計。不適用於多層／多變量統合分析或具異質性統合迴歸模型時。多層／多變量統合分析中更複雜的異質性項可透過『延伸 metafor 呼叫』選項固定。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Weights"
msgstr "權重"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Use custom weights for the effect sizes instead of inverse-variance weights."

msgstr "使用自訂權重來表示效果量，取代反向變異數權重。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Add Omibus Moderator Test"

msgstr "加入整體調節變項檢定"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Effect size coefficients"

msgstr "效果量係數"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Include an omnibus test for the specified effect size regression "
"coefficients. Available when effect size model terms are included. The "
"coefficients should be selected via their comma-separated indicies which "
"correspond to the order presented in the 'Effect Size Meta-Regression "
"Coefficients' Table."

msgstr "對指定的效果量迴歸係數進行整體檢定。包含效果量模型項時可用。係數應透過其半形逗號分隔的索引選取，索引對應於『效果量統合迴歸係數』表中呈現的順序。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Specify the indices of the effect size meta-regression coefficients to "
"include in the omnibus test, e.g. '(1, 2)' for the first and the second "
"coefficient."

msgstr "指定納入整體檢定之效果量統合迴歸係數的索引，例如用『(1, 2)』表示第一個與第二個係數。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Heterogeneity coefficients"

msgstr "異質性係數"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Include an omnibus test for the specified heterogeneity regression "
"coefficients. Available when heterogeneity model terms are included. The "
"coefficients should be selected via their comma-separated indicies which "
"correspond to the order presented in the 'Heterogeneity Meta-Regression "
"Coefficients' Table."

msgstr "對指定的異質性迴歸係數進行整體檢定。包含異質性模型項時可用。係數應透過其半形逗號分隔的索引選取，索引對應於『異質性統合迴歸係數』表中呈現的順序。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Specify the indices of the heterogeneity meta-regression coefficients to "
"include in the omnibus test, e.g. '(1, 2)' for the first and the second "
"coefficient."

msgstr "指定納入整體檢定之異質性統合迴歸係數的索引，例如用『(1, 2)』表示第一個與第二個係數。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Optimizer"

msgstr "最佳化器"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Optimizer settings for estimating the meta-analytic models. A more complex/"
"unavailbe settings can be specified via the 'Extend metafor call' option."

msgstr "用於估計統合分析模型的最佳化器設定。更複雜／無法取得的設定可透過『延伸 metafor 呼叫』選項指定。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Select the optimization method to use for fitting the model. Available in "
"multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis or when heterogeneity model terms are "
"included."

msgstr "選取用於適配模型的最佳化方法。適用於多層／多變量統合分析或包含異質性模型項時。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Initial 𝜏²"

msgstr "初始 𝜏²"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Specify the initial value of 𝜏² for the optimization algorithm. Available "
"only for specific optimization methods and unavailable in multilevel/"
"multivariate meta-analysis or when heterogeneity model terms are included."

msgstr "指定最佳化演算法的 𝜏² 初始值。僅適用於特定最佳化方法，且不適用於多層／多變量統合分析或包含異質性模型項時。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Minimum 𝜏²"

msgstr "最小 𝜏²"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Specify the minimum allowable value of 𝜏² during optimization. Available "
"only for specific optimization methods and unavailable in multilevel/"
"multivariate meta-analysis or when heterogeneity model terms are included."

msgstr "指定最佳化期間 𝜏² 的最小容許值。僅適用於特定最佳化方法，且不適用於多層／多變量統合分析或包含異質性模型項時。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Maximum 𝜏²"

msgstr "最大 𝜏²"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Maximum evaluations"

msgstr "最大評估次數"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Set the maximum number of function evaluations for the optimizer. Available "
"when using specific optimization methods in multilevel/multivariate meta-"
"analysis."

msgstr "設定最佳化器的函式評估次數上限。在多層／多變量統合分析中使用特定最佳化方法時可用。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Maximum iterations"

msgstr "最大迭代次數"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Set the maximum number of iterations for the optimizer. Available when using "
"certain estimation or optimization methods."

msgstr "設定最佳化器的迭代次數上限。使用特定估計或最佳化方法時可用。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Convergence tolerance"

msgstr "收斂容忍度"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Set the convergence tolerance for the optimizer. Available when using "
"certain methods without heterogeneity model terms or specific optimizers in "
"multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis."

msgstr "設定最佳化器的收斂容忍度。在不含異質性模型項的特定方法或多層／多變量統合分析中的特定最佳化器時可用。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Convergence relative tolerance"

msgstr "相對收斂容忍度"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Set the relative convergence tolerance for the optimizer. Available when "
"heterogeneity model terms are included or using specific optimizers in "
"multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis."

msgstr "設定最佳化器的相對收斂容忍度。包含異質性模型項或於多層／多變量統合分析中使用特定最佳化器時可用。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Step adjustment"

msgstr "步階調整"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Set the step adjustment factor for the optimizer. Available when using "
"certain methods without heterogeneity model terms and unavailable in "
"multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis."

msgstr "設定最佳化器的步階調整因子。在不含異質性模型項的特定方法時可用，且不適用於多層／多變量統合分析。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Initial trust region radius"

msgstr "初始信賴區半徑"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Set the initial trust region radius for the optimizer. Available when using "
"specific optimization methods in multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis."

msgstr "設定最佳化器的初始信賴區半徑。在多層／多變量統合分析中使用特定最佳化方法時可用。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Final trust region radius"

msgstr "最終信賴區半徑"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Set the final trust region radius for the optimizer. Available when using "
"specific optimization methods in multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis."

msgstr "設定最佳化器的最終信賴區半徑。在多層／多變量統合分析中使用特定最佳化方法時可用。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Maximum restarts"

msgstr "最大重啟次數"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Set the maximum number of restarts for the optimizer. Available when using "
"the Nelder-Mead method ('nmk') in multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis."

msgstr "設定最佳化器的最大重啟次數。在多層／多變量統合分析中使用 Nelder-Mead 方法（『nmk』）時可用。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Permutation test"

msgstr "置換檢定"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Type"
msgstr "類型"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Select the type of permutation test."

msgstr "選取置換檢定的類型。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Approximate"

msgstr "近似"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Exact"

msgstr "精確"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Iteration"

msgstr "迭代"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Specify the number of permutations to use in the approximate permutation "
"test."
msgstr "指定近似置換檢定中所使用之置換次數。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Extend metafor call"

msgstr "延伸 metafor 呼叫"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"The additional arguments to the metafor function call must be specified as a "
"named list (the 'list()' call can be ommited). E.g., 'list(tau2 = 1)' (or "
"'tau2 = 1') can be used to fix the between-study heterogeneity to a given "
"value. Multiple arguments must be comma-seprated, e.g. 'list(tau2 = 1, "
"gamma2 = 0.5)' (or 'tau2 = 1, gamma2 = 0.5'). New lines are ignored."

msgstr "metafor 函式呼叫的額外引數必須以具名清單指定（可省略『list()』呼叫）。例如，可用『list(tau2 = 1)』（或『tau2 = 1』）將研究間異質性固定為給定值。多個引數必須以半形逗號分隔，例如『list(tau2 = 1, gamma2 = 0.5)』（或『tau2 = 1, gamma2 = 0.5』）。換行會被忽略。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisDiagnostics|"
msgid ""
"Options for evaluating the influence of individual studies and assessing "
"model diagnostics, including variance inflation factors, casewise "
"diagnostics, and diagnostic plots."

msgstr "用於評估個別研究影響力與評估模型診斷的選項，包括變異膨脹因子、逐案診斷與診斷圖。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisDiagnostics|"
msgid "Variance inflation factor"

msgstr "變異膨脹因子"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisDiagnostics|"
msgid ""
"Include variance inflation factors to assess multicollinearity among "
"predictors. Available when predictors are included in the model."

msgstr "納入變異膨脹因子以評估預測變項間的多重共線性。模型中包含預測變項時可用。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisDiagnostics|"
msgid "Aggregate by terms"

msgstr "依模型項彙總"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisDiagnostics|"
msgid ""
"Aggregate variance inflation factors by terms instead of individual "
"coefficients."

msgstr "依模型項（而非個別係數）彙總變異膨脹因子。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisDiagnostics|"
msgid "Show influential only"

msgstr "僅顯示具影響力者"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisDiagnostics|"
msgid "Include predictors"

msgstr "包含預測變項"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisDiagnostics|"
msgid "Include predictor variables in the casewise diagnostics output."

msgstr "在逐案診斷輸出中包含預測變項。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisDiagnostics|"
msgid "Difference in coefficients"

msgstr "係數差異"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisDiagnostics|"
msgid ""
"Include the differences in model coefficients when each study is excluded "
"(DFBETAS)."

msgstr "納入排除每個研究後模型係數的差異（DFBETAS）。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisDiagnostics|"
msgid "Profile likelihood"

msgstr "剖面概似"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisDiagnostics|"
msgid "Include a profile likelihood plot for the heterogeneity parameter (τ²)."

msgstr "為異質性參數（τ²）納入剖面概似圖。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisDiagnostics|"
msgid "Baujat"

msgstr "Baujat"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisDiagnostics|"
msgid "Residual funnel"

msgstr "殘差漏斗圖"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid "Estimated Marginal Means"
msgstr "估計邊際平均值"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid "Effect size"
msgstr "效果量"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid ""
"Variables selected for computing estimated marginal means in the effect size "
"model."

msgstr "已選取用於在效果量模型中計算估計邊際平均的變項。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid "SD factor covariates"

msgstr "標準差因數共變項"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid ""
"Standard deviation factor for covariates when computing estimated marginal "
"means; applies to scale variables."

msgstr "計算估計邊際平均時共變項的標準差因數；適用於尺度變項。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid "Add adjusted estimate"

msgstr "加入調整後估計值"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid ""
"Include the adjusted effect estimate, which accounts for the moderators in "
"the meta-regression model. This provides the effect size adjusted for the "
"influence of moderators, as opposed to the pooled effect which combines the "
"estimates across all studies."

msgstr "納入考量統合迴歸模型中調節變項的調整後效果估計值。此提供針對調節變項影響調整後的效果量，相對於合併所有研究估計值的合併效果。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid "Test against"

msgstr "對照檢定"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid "Option to test the estimated marginal means against a specific value."
msgstr "對估計邊際平均數進行特定值檢定的選項。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid "Heterogeneity"
msgstr "異質性"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid ""
"Include the adjusted heterogeneity estimate, which accounts for the "
"moderators in the heterogeneity meta-regression model. This provides the "
"heterogeneity estimate adjusted for the influence of moderators, as opposed "
"to the pooled heterogeneity estimate which combines the heterogeneity "
"estimates across all studies."

msgstr "納入考量異質性統合迴歸模型中調節變項的調整後異質性估計值。此提供針對調節變項影響調整後的異質性估計值，相對於合併所有研究異質性估計值的合併異質性估計值。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid "Heterogeneity transformation"

msgstr "異質性轉換"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid ""
"Transformation to apply to the heterogeneity estimate: tau (𝜏) or tau-"
"squared (𝜏²)."

msgstr "套用至異質性估計值的轉換：tau（𝜏）或 tau 平方（𝜏²）。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid "𝜏"

msgstr "𝜏"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid "𝜏²"

msgstr "𝜏²"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisModel|"
msgid "Model"
msgstr "模型"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisModel|"
msgid ""
"Options for specifing the effect size and heterogeneity models based on the "
"included predictors, including model terms, intercepts, and link functions."

msgstr "根據納入的預測變項指定效果量與異質性模型的選項，包括模型項、截距與連結函式。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisModel|"
msgid "Available Components"

msgstr "可用組成"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisModel|"
msgid "Model Terms"
msgstr "模型"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisModel|"
msgid "Variables assigned as model terms in the effect size model."

msgstr "指派為效果量模型中模型項的變項。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisModel|"
msgid "Include intercept"
msgstr "包含截距"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisModel|"
msgid "Include an intercept in the effect size model."

msgstr "在效果量模型中納入截距。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisModel|"
msgid ""
"Variables assigned as model terms in the heterogeneity model. Specifying a "
"heterogeneity model results in a 'location-scale' meta-analytic model."

msgstr "指派為異質性模型中模型項的變項。指定異質性模型會產生『位置－尺度』統合分析模型。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisModel|"
msgid "Include an intercept in the heterogeneity model."

msgstr "在異質性模型中納入截距。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisModel|"
msgid "Link"

msgstr "連結函式"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisModel|"
msgid "Link function used in the heterogeneity model: 'log' or 'identity'."

msgstr "異質性模型中使用的連結函式：『log』或『identity』。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Options for summarizing the meta-analytic results."

msgstr "彙總統合分析結果的選項。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Heterogeneity"
msgstr "異質性"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "𝜏"

msgstr "𝜏"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Include 𝜏, the square root of the estimated between-study variance."

msgstr "納入 𝜏，即估計研究間變異數的平方根。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "𝜏²"

msgstr "𝜏²"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Include 𝜏², the estimated between-study variance."

msgstr "納入 𝜏²，即估計的研究間變異數。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "I²"

msgstr "I²"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid ""
"Include I², the percentage of total variation across studies due to "
"heterogeneity."

msgstr "納入 I²，即研究間因異質性造成的總變異百分比。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "H²"

msgstr "H²"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid ""
"Include H², an index indicating the ratio of total variability to sampling "
"variability."

msgstr "納入 H²，即表示總變異與抽樣變異比率的指標。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Available when performing multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis."

msgstr "進行多層／多變量統合分析時可用。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Test inclusion"

msgstr "納入檢定"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Meta-Regression"

msgstr "統合迴歸"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid ""
"Create summaries of the meta-regression. Available when predictors are "
"included."

msgstr "建立統合迴歸的摘要。包含預測變項時可用。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Term tests"

msgstr "模型項檢定"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid ""
"Include tests for each term in the meta-regression model. The null "
"hypothesis states that the effect size at all levels of the categorical "
"variable are equal or that there is no linear association between the effect "
"size and the continuous variable)."

msgstr "對統合迴歸模型中的每個模型項納入檢定。虛無假設為類別變項所有水準的效果量皆相等，或效果量與連續變項之間無線性關聯）。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Coefficient estimates"

msgstr "係數估計值"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid ""
"Include estimates of the regression coefficients in the meta-regression "
"model."

msgstr "納入統合迴歸模型中迴歸係數的估計值。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Coefficient correlation matrix"

msgstr "係數相關矩陣"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Include the correlation matrix of the regression coefficients."

msgstr "納入迴歸係數的相關矩陣。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Include confidence intervals in the tabular output."

msgstr "在表格輸出中納入信賴區間。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Prediction intervals"

msgstr "預測區間"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Include prediction intervals in the tabular output."

msgstr "在表格輸出中納入預測區間。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Transform effect size"

msgstr "轉換效果量"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid ""
"Select a transformation to apply to the effect size estimates in the output. "
"This transformation applies to the 'Meta-Analytic Estimates Table', "
"'Estimated Marginal Means Table', 'Forest Plot', and  the 'Bubble Plot'. The "
"'Meta-Regression Coeffient Estimates' are not transformed."

msgstr "選取套用至輸出中效果量估計值的轉換。此轉換適用於『統合分析估計值表』、『估計邊際平均表』、『森林圖』與『泡泡圖』。『統合迴歸係數估計值』不會被轉換。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "None"
msgstr "無"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Fisher's z to r"

msgstr "費雪 z 轉 r"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Exponential"

msgstr "指數"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Log odds to proportions"

msgstr "對數勝算轉比例"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Log odds to SMD (normal)"

msgstr "對數勝算轉 SMD（常態）"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Log odds to SMD (logistic)"

msgstr "對數勝算轉 SMD（邏輯）"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "SMD to log odds (normal)"

msgstr "SMD 轉對數勝算（常態）"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "SMD to log odds (logistic)"

msgstr "SMD 轉對數勝算（邏輯）"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Hakstian & Whalen inverse α"

msgstr "Hakstian 與 Whalen 反向 α"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Bonett inverse α"

msgstr "Bonett 反向 α"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Z to R²"

msgstr "Z 轉 R²"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "SMD to Cohen's U₁"

msgstr "SMD 轉科恩 U₁"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "SMD to Cohen's U₂"

msgstr "SMD 轉科恩 U₂"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "SMD to Cohen's U₃"

msgstr "SMD 轉科恩 U₃"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Include fit statistics for the model, such as AIC and BIC."

msgstr "納入模型的適配統計量，例如 AIC 與 BIC。"
msgctxt "Upgrades|"
msgid ""
"Results of this analysis cannot be updated. The analysis was created with an "
"older version of JASP and the analysis options are not longer compatible. "
"Please, redo the analysis with the updated module or download the 0.19.1 "
"version of JASP to rerun or edit the analysis."

msgstr "此分析的結果無法更新。此分析是以較舊版本的 JASP 建立，分析選項已不再相容。請使用更新後的模組重新執行分析，或下載 0.19.1 版的 JASP 以重新執行或編輯此分析。"
msgctxt "PredictionPerformanceInference|"
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

msgctxt "PredictionPerformanceInference|"
msgid "Fixed Effects"
msgstr "固定效果"

msgctxt "PredictionPerformanceInference|"
msgid "Maximum Likelihood"
msgstr "最大概似法"

msgctxt "PredictionPerformanceInference|"
msgid "Restricted ML"
msgstr "限制性最大似似法"

msgctxt "PredictionPerformanceInference|"
msgid "DerSimonian-Laird"
msgstr "DerSimonian-Laird法"

msgctxt "PredictionPerformanceInference|"
msgid "Hedges"
msgstr "黑吉斯(Hedges)"

msgctxt "PredictionPerformanceInference|"
msgid "Hunter-Schmidt"
msgstr "亨特(Hunter)-施密特(Schmidt)"

msgctxt "PredictionPerformanceInference|"
msgid "Sidik-Jonkman"
msgstr "Sidik和Jonkman"

msgctxt "PredictionPerformanceInference|"
msgid "Empirical Bayes"
msgstr "經驗貝氏"

msgctxt "PredictionPerformanceInference|"
msgid "Paule-Mandel"
msgstr "Paule和Mandel"

msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Estimate the mean effect size and heterogeneity under the alternative "
"hypothesis. The paramters are estimated with the 'Method' specified under "
"'General Settings'."

msgstr "估計對立假設下的平均效果量與異質性。參數以『一般設定』下所指定的『方法』進行估計。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "General Settings"

msgstr "一般設定"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Select the heterogeneity estimation method for the funnel plot under the "
"alternative hypothesis, meta-regression funnel plot asymmetry tests, trim "
"and fill, and the fail-safe N general method."

msgstr "選取對立假設下漏斗圖、統合迴歸漏斗圖不對稱性檢定、修剪與填補，以及失安全 N 一般方法所用之異質性估計方法。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Publication Bias / Sensitivity Analyses"

msgstr "出版偏誤／敏感度分析"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Detect and perform sensitivity analyses to funel plot asymmetry, publication "
"bias, and small-study effects."

msgstr "偵測並對漏斗圖不對稱性、出版偏誤與小型研究效應進行敏感度分析。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Asymmetry tests"

msgstr "不對稱性檢定"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Perform tests to detect asymmetry in the funnel plot indicating potential "
"publication bias."

msgstr "執行檢定以偵測漏斗圖中可能表示出版偏誤的不對稱性。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Include meta-regression tests for funnel plot asymmetry. The test is "
"performed with the 'Method' specified under 'General Settings'."

msgstr "納入漏斗圖不對稱性的統合迴歸檢定。此檢定以『一般設定』下所指定的『方法』執行。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Weighted regression (Egger's test)"

msgstr "加權迴歸（Egger 檢定）"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Include weighted regression tests (also known as Egger's test) for funnel "
"plot asymmetry."

msgstr "納入漏斗圖不對稱性的加權迴歸檢定（又稱 Egger 檢定）。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Rank correlation (Begg's test)"

msgstr "等級相關（Begg 檢定）"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Include rank correlation tests (also known as Begg's test) for funnel plot "
"asymmetry."

msgstr "納入漏斗圖不對稱性的等級相關檢定（又稱 Begg 檢定）。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Trim and fill"

msgstr "修剪與填補"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Perform the trim and fill to adjust the funnel plot for publication bias. "
"The test is performed with the 'Method' specified under 'General Settings'."

msgstr "執行修剪與填補以對出版偏誤調整漏斗圖。此檢定以『一般設定』下所指定的『方法』執行。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Estimator"

msgstr "估計子"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Select the method for the trim-and-fill adjustment."

msgstr "選取修剪與填補調整的方法。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "L0"

msgstr "L0"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "R0"

msgstr "R0"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Q0"

msgstr "Q0"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Include heterogeneity (𝜏) in the trim and fill funnel plot. If unselected, "
"the heterogeneity estimate is not used to adjust the prediction intervals."

msgstr "在修剪與填補漏斗圖中包含異質性（𝜏）。若未選取，則不使用異質性估計值調整預測區間。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Summarize the effect size, heterogeneity, and number of imputed "
"estimatesused for the trim and fill in a table."

msgstr "以表格摘要用於修剪與填補的效果量、異質性與插補估計值數目。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Fill the funnel plot's prediction intervals under trim and fill with "
"different colors."

msgstr "以不同顏色填入修剪與填補下漏斗圖的預測區間。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Set the type of line of the funnel plot's prediction intervals under trim "
"and fill."

msgstr "設定修剪與填補下漏斗圖預測區間的線條類型。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Fail-safe N"

msgstr "失安全 N"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Compute the minimum number of studies averaging null results that would have "
"to be added to a given set of studies to change the conclusion of a meta-"
"analysis tests to detect asymmetry in the funnel plot indicating potential "
"publication bias."

msgstr "計算必須加至給定研究集合、使統合分析之偵測漏斗圖不對稱性（表示潛在出版偏誤）的結論改變之平均虛無結果研究的最低數目。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Rosenthal"

msgstr "Rosenthal"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"The Rosenthal method calculates the minimum number of studies averaging null "
"results needed to reduce the combined significance level to a specified "
"alpha level."

msgstr "Rosenthal 方法計算將合併顯著性水準降至指定 alpha 水準所需的平均虛無結果研究的最低數目。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Orwin"

msgstr "Orwin"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"The Orwin method calculates the minimum number of studies averaging null "
"results needed to reduce the average effect size to a target value. The "
"default is set to 0.10 which is completely aribitrary."

msgstr "Orwin 方法計算將平均效果量降至目標值所需的平均虛無結果研究的最低數目。預設設為 0.10，此值完全是任意的。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Rosenberg"

msgstr "Rosenberg"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"The Rosenberg method calculates the minimum number of studies averaging null "
"results needed to reduce the significance level of the average effect size "
"to a specified alpha level."

msgstr "Rosenberg 方法計算將平均效果量的顯著性水準降至指定 alpha 水準所需的平均虛無結果研究的最低數目。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "General"

msgstr "一般"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"A general method to calculate the minimum number of studies averaging null "
"results needed to reduce the significance level or the average effect size "
"to a target effect size value. The default is set to 0.10 which is "
"completely aribitrary."

msgstr "計算將顯著性水準或平均效果量降至目標效果量值所需的平均虛無結果研究最低數目的一般方法。預設設為 0.10，此值完全是任意的。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Exact"

msgstr "精確"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Use the exact method to calculate the fail-safe N."

msgstr "使用精確方法計算失安全 N。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Alpha"

msgstr "Alpha"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Set the significance level for the Rosenthal's, Rosenberg's, and general "
"fail-safe N tests."

msgstr "設定 Rosenthal、Rosenberg 與一般失安全 N 檢定的顯著性水準。"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid "Target effect size"

msgstr "目標效果量"
msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Set the target effect size for the Orwin's and general fail-safe N tests."

msgstr "設定 Orwin 與一般失安全 N 檢定的目標效果量。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultilevelMultivariate|"
msgid "Random Effects / Model Components"

msgstr "隨機效果／模型組成"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultilevelMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Options for specifying the random effects components for the meta-analysis "
"model, including the types of random effects and their associated variables. "
"Allows modeling of complex data structures such as multilevel, multivariate, "
"autoregressive, spatial, and other forms of dependency."

msgstr "指定統合分析模型隨機效果組成的選項，包括隨機效果類型及其相關變項。可對多層、多變量、自迴歸、空間及其他形式相依性等複雜資料結構進行建模。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultilevelMultivariate|"
msgid "Component %1"

msgstr "組成 %1"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Allow adding custom arguments to the metafor function call. Consult the "
"metafor R package documentation for the available commands (for %1meta-"
"analysis%2 and %3meta-analysis (multilevel/multivariate)%4)."

msgstr "允許在 metafor 函式呼叫中新增自訂引數。請參閱 metafor R 套件文件以了解可用指令（用於 %1統合分析%2 與 %3統合分析（多層／多變量）%4）。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid "Estimated Marginal Means and Contrasts"

msgstr "估計邊際平均與對比"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid ""
"Options to compute estimated marginal means (EMMs) and coefficient contrasts "
"for the effect size and heterogeneity models, allowing examination of "
"predicted values at specific levels of moderators and their differences."

msgstr "計算效果量與異質性模型之估計邊際平均（EMM）與係數對比的選項，可檢視調節變項特定水準的預測值及其差異。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid "Contrasts"

msgstr "對比"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid "P-value adjustment"

msgstr "P 值調整"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid "None"
msgstr "無"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Random Effects / Model Components"

msgstr "隨機效果／模型組成"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Include confidence intervals for the Random Effects / Model Components."
msgstr "包含隨機效果／模型組成部分的信賴區間。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid ""
"Test the inclusion of the individual Random Effects / Model Components. The "
"test compares the complete model (i.e., including all components) with a "
"model without one of the specified Random Effects / Model Structure "
"components at a time."

msgstr "檢定個別隨機效果／模型組成的納入。此檢定一次將完整模型（即包含所有組成）與缺少其中一個指定隨機效果／模型結構組成的模型進行比較。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Variables to include as predictors (moderators) in the meta-regression "
"model. See the 'Model' section for the meta-regression specification details."

msgstr "納入統合迴歸模型中作為預測變項（調節變項）的變項。關於統合迴歸規格細節請見『模型』區段。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Variable indicating clustering of effect sizes for robust variance "
"estimation. If the variable is specified, a cluster-robust tests and "
"confidence intervals are provided. See 'Details' section for additional "
"clustering options. This option is disabled when permutation tests are "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"用於表示效果量分群的變項，以進行穩健變異估計。若指定此變項，將提供分群穩健檢"
"定及信賴區間。更多分群選項請參見「Details」區段。選擇置換檢定時，此選項將被停"
"用。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Subgroup"

msgstr "子群"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Variable indicating subgroup stratification. For each subgroup, an "
"independent model is fitted to the corresponding data set subset."

msgstr "指示子群分層的變項。對每個子群，都會在對應的資料集子集上適配一個獨立模型。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultilevelMultivariate|"
msgid "Subgroup"

msgstr "子群"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultilevelMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable indicating subgroup stratification. For each subgroup, an "
"independent model is fitted to the corresponding data set subset."

msgstr "指示子群分層的變項。對每個子群，都會在對應的資料集子集上適配一個獨立模型。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Include full dataset in subgroup analysis"

msgstr "在子群分析中包含完整資料集"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Include the full dataset output in the subgroup analysis. This option is "
"only available when the subgroup analysis is selected."
