msgstr "預測變項"

msgctxt "BayesianBinomialMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Variables to include as predictors (moderators) in the meta-regression "
"model. See the 'Model' section for the meta-regression specification details."

msgstr "納入統合迴歸模型中作為預測變項（調節變項）的變項。關於統合迴歸規格細節請見『模型』區段。"
msgctxt "BayesianBinomialMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Study Level (Multilevel)"

msgstr "研究層級（多層）"
msgctxt "BayesianBinomialMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Variable indicating the study level nesting. This variable is used to "
"specify the nesting of the studies in the meta-analysis. The nesting is used "
"to specify the model structure and to account for the correlation between "
"the effect sizes within each study."

msgstr "指示研究層級巢狀結構的變項。此變項用於指定統合分析中研究的巢狀結構。該巢狀結構用於指定模型結構並考量每個研究內效果量之間的相關。"
msgctxt "BayesianBinomialMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Subgroup"

msgstr "子群"
msgctxt "BayesianBinomialMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Variable indicating subgroup stratification. For each subgroup, an "
"independent model is fitted to the corresponding data set subset."

msgstr "指示子群分層的變項。對每個子群，都會在對應的資料集子集上適配一個獨立模型。"
msgctxt "BayesianBinomialMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Effect size"
msgstr "效果量"

msgctxt "BayesianBinomialMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Average over the presence vs. absence of the effect. If unspecified, the "
"resulting model assumes that the effect is present."

msgstr "在效果存在與否之間取平均。若未指定，產生的模型假定效果存在。"
msgctxt "BayesianBinomialMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Heterogeneity"
msgstr "異質性"

