msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisDiagnostics|"
msgid ""
"Include casewise diagnostics to assess the influence of individual studies "
"on the meta-analysis results. Note that diagnostics are always based on the "
"non-clustered model."

msgstr "納入逐案診斷以評估個別研究對統合分析結果的影響力。請注意，診斷一律基於非叢集模型。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisDiagnostics|"
msgid ""
"Show only the influential studies in the casewise diagnostics. Unavailable "
"when performing multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis."

msgstr "僅在逐案診斷中顯示具影響力的研究。進行多層／多變量統合分析時不可用。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisDiagnostics|"
msgid ""
"Include a Baujat plot to detect studies contributing to heterogeneity and "
"overall effect size. Unavailable when performing multilevel/multivariate "
"meta-analysis. Note that Baujat plot is always based on the non-clustered "
"model."

msgstr "納入 Baujat 圖以偵測促成異質性與整體效果量的研究。進行多層／多變量統合分析時不可用。請注意，Baujat 圖一律基於非叢集模型。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisDiagnostics|"
msgid ""
"Include a residual funnel plot. Note that residual funnel plot is always "
"based on the non-clustered model."

msgstr "納入殘差漏斗圖。請注意，殘差漏斗圖一律基於非叢集模型。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid ""
"Variables selected for computing estimated marginal means in the "
"heterogeneity model. Unavailable when performing multilevel/multivariate "
"meta-analysis."

msgstr "已選取用於在異質性模型中計算估計邊際平均的變項。進行多層／多變量統合分析時不可用。"
msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid ""
