msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Generalized (GLMM) meta-analysis fits meta-analytic models via generalized "
"linear (mixed-effects) models using metafor's rma.glmm function. It directly "
"models event counts and proportions without requiring pre-computed effect "
"sizes, making it suitable for sparse binary and count data where the normal "
"approximation breaks down."

msgstr "廣義（GLMM）統合分析透過 metafor 的 rma.glmm 函式，以廣義線性（混合效果）模型適配統合分析模型。它直接對事件計數與比例建模，不需預先計算效果量，因此適用於常態近似失效的稀疏二元與計數資料。"
msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "References"

msgstr "參考文獻"
