msgstr "對數發生率比"
msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Model type"

msgstr "模型類型"
msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the generalized linear model type. UM.FS = unconditional with fixed "
"study effects (default); UM.RS = unconditional with random study effects; CM."
"AL = conditional with approximate likelihood (odds ratios only); CM.EL = "
"conditional with exact likelihood (odds ratios and incidence rate ratios)."

msgstr "選取廣義線性模型類型。UM.FS = 無條件且具固定研究效果（預設）；UM.RS = 無條件且具隨機研究效果；CM.AL = 條件式且具近似概似（僅勝算比）；CM.EL = 條件式且具精確概似（勝算比與發生率比）。"
msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Unconditional (fixed study effects)"

msgstr "無條件（固定研究效果）"
msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Unconditional (random study effects)"

msgstr "無條件（隨機研究效果）"
msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Conditional (approximate likelihood)"

msgstr "條件式（近似概似）"
msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Conditional (exact likelihood)"

msgstr "條件式（精確概似）"
msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the estimation method. Maximum Likelihood estimates a random-effects "
"model; Equal Effects fixes tau-squared to zero."

msgstr "選取估計方法。最大概似估計隨機效果模型；相等效果將 tau 平方固定為零。"
