msgstr "係數檢定"
msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Test type for the fixed-effect coefficients: z (Wald test) or t (t-"
"distribution)."

msgstr "固定效果係數的檢定類型：z（Wald 檢定）或 t（t 分配）。"
