msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Overall Judgment"

msgstr "整體判定"
msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Variable containing the overall risk-of-bias judgment for each study."

msgstr "包含每個研究整體偏誤風險判定的變項。"
msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Weights"
msgstr "權重"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid ""
"Variable containing study weights for weighted summary plots (e.g., inverse-"
"variance weights)."

msgstr "為加權摘要圖（例如反向變異數權重）包含研究權重的變項。"
msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Plots"
msgstr "圖"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Summary plot"

msgstr "摘要圖"
msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid ""
"Display a bar chart showing the distribution of risk-of-bias judgments "
"across domains."

msgstr "顯示條形圖，以呈現各領域偏誤風險判定的分布。"
msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Weighted by study precision"

msgstr "依研究精確度加權"
msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid ""
"Weight the summary bars by study precision. Requires a weights variable."

msgstr "依研究精確度對摘要長條加權。需有權重變項。"
msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Traffic light plot"

msgstr "紅綠燈圖"
msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid ""
"Display a matrix of colored circles showing per-study, per-domain risk-of-"
"bias judgments."

msgstr "顯示彩色圓點矩陣，呈現每個研究、每個領域的偏誤風險判定。"
msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Point size"

msgstr "點大小"
msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Size of the traffic light circles."

msgstr "紅綠燈圓點的大小。"
msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Appearance"

msgstr "外觀"
msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Color scheme"

msgstr "配色方案"
msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Select the color palette for risk-of-bias judgments."

msgstr "選取偏誤風險判定的色票。"
msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Cochrane"

msgstr "Cochrane"
msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Colourblind"

msgstr "色盲友善"
msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the meta-analytic I², the percentage of total variation across "
"studies due to heterogeneity in the model information section. Not available "
"for multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis or heterogeneity meta-regression."
msgstr ""
"於模型資訊區段納入整合分析之 I²，即各研究間因異質性所導致的總變異百分比。不適"
"用於多層次 / 多變量整合分析或異質性整合迴歸。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the meta-analytic H², an index indicating the ratio of total "
"variability to sampling variability in the model information section. Not "
"available for multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis or heterogeneity meta-"
"regression."
msgstr ""
"於模型資訊區段納入整合分析之 H²，該指標表示模型中總變異量與抽樣變異量之比值。"
"不適用於多層次 / 多變量整合分析或異質性整合迴歸。"
